# Memory Index

One line per entry: `- [Title](entries/<slug>.md) — <hook>`

The hook is what a future session reads to decide whether to open the entry,
so make it specific. "Base branch gotcha" is useless; "chart repo bases on
develop even though the remote advertises main" is not.

<!-- Examples — replace with your own -->

- [Targeted applies only](entries/targeted-applies-only.md) — never untargeted in the shared infra state; others have changes in flight
- [Chart repo base branch](entries/chart-repo-base-branch.md) — bases on develop; the remote advertises main, so probing matters
- [Prod means prod](entries/prod-requires-explicit-word.md) — never touch production unless I used the word "production"
